{{!
    @template block_coursecare/overview

    The "Your course in numbers" page of the CourseCare block (Feature 003, contracts/overview-page.md).
    Every sentence comes already translated from the course_overview renderable; this template only lays
    them out. Sections without data are left out (states A, B, C and G).

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * title, intro, backurl, backtext - page title, introduction and the way back to the course
    * summary - list of objects with "text": the sentences about the state of the diagnostic
    * hascategories, categories - see block_coursecare/overview_categories
    * hasactivities, activities - see block_coursecare/overview_activities

    Example context (json):
    {
        "title": "Your course in numbers",
        "intro": "Get to know the files of your course: where they are and when they were measured.",
        "backurl": "https://example.com/course/view.php?id=2",
        "backtext": "Back to the course",
        "summary": [
            {"text": "Files in this course, as recorded by Moodle: 6.0 MB"},
            {"text": "Calculated on 16/10/26, 10:12."}
        ],
        "hascategories": false,
        "hasactivities": false
    }
}}
<div class="block_coursecare-overview">
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_summary }}
    {{#hascategories}}
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_categories }}
    {{/hascategories}}
    {{#hasactivities}}
    {{> block_coursecare/overview_activities }}
    {{/hasactivities}}
</div>
